{"seq":5,"slug":"lc0115-distinct-subsequences","title":"LeetCode 115 不同的子序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0115-distinct-subsequences","wordCount":661,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-115-不同的子序列\">LeetCode 115 不同的子序列</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定两个字符串 <code>s</code> 和 <code>t</code>，计算在 <code>s</code> 的所有子序列中 <code>t</code> 出现的<strong>个数</strong>。</p>\n<p>字符串的一个<strong>子序列</strong>是指通过删除一些（也可以不删除）字符且不干扰剩余字符相对位置所组成的新字符串。例如 <code>&quot;ACE&quot;</code> 是 <code>&quot;ABCDE&quot;</code> 的一个子序列，但 <code>&quot;AEC&quot;</code> 不是。</p>\n<p>题目数据保证答案符合 32 位带符号整数范围。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length, t.length &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n<li><code>s</code> 和 <code>t</code> 由英文字母组成</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot;rabbbit&quot;, t = &quot;rabbit&quot;&#10;输出：3&#10;解释：有 3 种从 s 中选出 &quot;rabbit&quot; 的方式（选择不同的 &#39;b&#39;）。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"rabbbit\", t = \"rabbit\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：有 3 种从 s 中选出 \"rabbit\" 的方式（选择不同的 'b'）。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s = &quot;babgbag&quot;, t = &quot;bag&quot;&#10;输出：5&#10;解释：有 5 种选法：ba_g_ag, ba___ag, b___bag, _a_gbag, _a__bag（下划线表示跳过的字符）。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s = \"babgbag\", t = \"bag\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：有 5 种选法：ba_g_ag, ba___ag, b___bag, _a_gbag, _a__bag（下划线表示跳过的字符）。</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是经典的<strong>二维 DP 计数</strong>问题。与编辑距离不同，这里不是求最优解，而是求方案数。</p>\n<p><strong>状态定义：</strong> <code>dp[i][j]</code> 表示 <code>s</code> 的前 <code>i</code> 个字符的子序列中，<code>t</code> 的前 <code>j</code> 个字符出现的次数。</p>\n<p><strong>状态转移：</strong></p>\n<p>对于每个位置 <code>(i, j)</code>，考虑 <code>s[i-1]</code> 是否参与匹配：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>不选 <code>s[i-1]</code></strong>：不论 <code>s[i-1]</code> 是什么，都可以跳过它，方案数为 <code>dp[i-1][j]</code></li>\n<li><strong>选 <code>s[i-1]</code></strong>：只有当 <code>s[i-1] === t[j-1]</code> 时才可以选，方案数为 <code>dp[i-1][j-1]</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p>因此：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果 <code>s[i-1] === t[j-1]</code>：<code>dp[i][j] = dp[i-1][j-1] + dp[i-1][j]</code></li>\n<li>如果 <code>s[i-1] !== t[j-1]</code>：<code>dp[i][j] = dp[i-1][j]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>初始化：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dp[i][0] = 1</code>：空串 <code>t</code> 是任何字符串的子序列（什么都不选）</li>\n<li><code>dp[0][j] = 0</code>（j &gt; 0）：空串 <code>s</code> 无法包含非空 <code>t</code></li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[dp[i][j] 的转移&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B{&quot;s[i-1] == t[j-1]?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[dp[i-1][j-1] + dp[i-1][j]&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[选 s[i-1] 匹配&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[跳过 s[i-1]&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[dp[i-1][j]&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[只能跳过 s[i-1]&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[dp[i][j] 的转移\"]\n    A --&gt; B{\"s[i-1] == t[j-1]?\"}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[dp[i-1][j-1] + dp[i-1][j]\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[选 s[i-1] 匹配\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[跳过 s[i-1]\"]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[dp[i-1][j]\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[只能跳过 s[i-1]\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二维 DP</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>直观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一维滚动 DP</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>空间优化，需逆序遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆化递归</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>自顶向下</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>二维 DP：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function numDistinct(s: string, t: string): number {&#10;  const m = s.length;&#10;  const n = t.length;&#10;  const dp: number[][] = Array.from({ length: m + 1 }, () =&gt; new Array(n + 1).fill(0));&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt;= m; i++) {&#10;    dp[i][0] = 1;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt;= m; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = 1; j &lt;= n; j++) {&#10;      dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j];&#10;      if (s[i - 1] === t[j - 1]) {&#10;        dp[i][j] += dp[i - 1][j - 1];&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[m][n];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> numDistinct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dp[i][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dp[i][j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][j];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (s[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dp[i][j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[m][n];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>一维空间优化（逆序遍历）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function numDistinctOptimized(s: string, t: string): number {&#10;  const m = s.length;&#10;  const n = t.length;&#10;  const dp = new Array(n + 1).fill(0);&#10;  dp[0] = 1;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt;= m; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = n; j &gt;= 1; j--) {&#10;      if (s[i - 1] === t[j - 1]) {&#10;        dp[j] += dp[j - 1];&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[n];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> numDistinctOptimized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (s[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dp[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[n];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>为什么一维版本要逆序遍历？</strong></p>\n<p>在二维 DP 中，<code>dp[i][j]</code> 依赖于 <code>dp[i-1][j-1]</code> 和 <code>dp[i-1][j]</code>（都是上一行的值）。压缩到一维后，如果正序遍历 <code>j</code>，更新 <code>dp[j]</code> 时 <code>dp[j-1]</code> 已经被覆盖为当前行的值。逆序遍历确保 <code>dp[j-1]</code> 仍是上一行的值。</p>\n<p><strong>DP 表格示例（s=&quot;rabbbit&quot;, t=&quot;rabbit&quot;）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"      &quot;&quot;  r  a  b  b  i  t&#10;&quot;&quot;     1  0  0  0  0  0  0&#10;r      1  1  0  0  0  0  0&#10;a      1  1  1  0  0  0  0&#10;b      1  1  1  1  0  0  0&#10;b      1  1  1  2  1  0  0&#10;b      1  1  1  3  3  0  0&#10;i      1  1  1  3  3  3  0&#10;t      1  1  1  3  3  3  3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>      \"\"  r  a  b  b  i  t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"\"     1  0  0  0  0  0  0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>r      1  1  0  0  0  0  0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>a      1  1  1  0  0  0  0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>b      1  1  1  1  0  0  0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>b      1  1  1  2  1  0  0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>b      1  1  1  3  3  0  0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>i      1  1  1  3  3  3  0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>t      1  1  1  3  3  3  3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>答案 <code>dp[7][6] = 3</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>二维 DP</th>\n<th>一维优化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 填充 (m+1) × (n+1) 的表格，每个格子 O(1)。m, n ≤ 1000 时约 100 万次操作。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 一维版本只需 O(n) 空间，因为每行只依赖上一行。</p>\n<p><strong>与编辑距离的对比：</strong> 编辑距离求最小值（min），本题求方案数（sum）。编辑距离中字符不同时有三种选择，本题中字符不同时只能跳过。本质上，编辑距离是优化问题，本题是计数问题，但都是二维字符串 DP 的经典范式。</p>\n<p><strong>溢出风险：</strong> 题目保证答案在 32 位整数范围内，但中间计算可能溢出。在 JavaScript/TypeScript 中，Number 类型可安全处理到 2^53，因此无需特殊处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 115 不同的子序列","id":"leetcode-115-不同的子序列"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 87 扰乱字符串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0087-scramble-string"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 123 买卖股票的最佳时机 III","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0123-best-time-to-buy-sell-stock-iii"}}